    "long_instructions": "## Campus Help Desk\r\n\r\nDesign and test your own mini-app by writing small, reusable functions that update a variable and the page. \r\n\r\n* **Plan it**: Fill in your **Function Plan** in your Activity Guide.\r\n* **Build it**: Write the functions in `script.js` using **arrow notation** and add a one-line **comment** above each function.\r\n* **Wire it up**: Connect each function to a button with `addEventListener`.\r\n* **Test it**: Click your buttons and confirm the change.\r\n* **Refactor if needed**: If you spot 3 similar lines, move them into a reusable function and call it as needed. \r\n* **Score it**: Use your **Scorecard** in your Activity Guide to self-check clarity, naming, and reuse. \r\n* **\r\nUse AI to Help You\r\n* Explain your code line-by-line in plain language.\r\n* Suggest clearer, verb-first names or better comment stems.\r\n* Check math or logic in your formulas.\r\n* Identify repeated steps you could refactor—without writing new code.\r\n* Sanity-check: “Did I define before I call?” “Does each function have one job?”\r\n",
    "display_name": "Campus Help Desk",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <title>L4 — Campus Help Desk</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  <script defer src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <h1>Campus Help Desk</h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Create, assign, and close support tickets for students and staff.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"status-strip\">\n      <span class=\"badge\" id=\"badgeStatus\">Online</span>\n      <span class=\"badge\">Hours: 8:00–17:00</span>\n      <span class=\"badge\">Queue: <strong id=\"badgeQueue\">0</strong></span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"notice\" id=\"systemNotice\">\n      Scheduled maintenance tonight at 7pm. Submit urgent tickets before 6:30pm.\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"container card\">\n    <section class=\"status\">\n      <div class=\"stat\">\n        <p class=\"stat-label\">Open Tickets</p>\n        <p id=\"ticketCount\" class=\"stat-value\">0</p>\n      </div>\n      <p id=\"output\" class=\"output\">Ready.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"controls\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Actions</h2>\n      <div id=\"buttons\" class=\"button-row\">\n        <button id=\"btnNew\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">New Ticket</button>\n        <button id=\"btnAssign\" class=\"btn\">Assign Tech</button>\n        <button id=\"btnClose\" class=\"btn btn-danger\">Close Ticket</button>\n        <button id=\"btnReset\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Reset</button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <small>Campus IT Services</small>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "/* Base */\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: #0f172a;\n  background: #f7f7fb;\n}\n\n.site-header {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 20px 12px;\n  background: #ffe8dc;             /* soft coral band */\n}\n\n.site-header h1 {\n  margin: 6px 0;\n  color: #9a3412;                   /* burnt orange */\n}\n\n.lede {\n  margin: 0;\n  color: #7a2e0e;\n}\n\n.container {\n  max-width: 860px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 18px;\n}\n\n/* Status section */\n.status {\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  padding: 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n.stat {\n  display: inline-block;\n  vertical-align: top;\n  margin-right: 16px;\n}\n\n.stat-label {\n  color: #64748b;\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n}\n\n.stat-value {\n  font-size: 32px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n/* Output */\n.output {\n  display: inline-block;\n  border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: #fbfdff;\n  padding: 8px 10px;\n  min-height: 28px;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n/* Status strip */\n.status-strip {\n  margin-top: 8px;\n}\n\n.badge {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: 4px 10px;\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  color: #334155;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  margin: 2px 4px 0 4px;\n}\n\n/* Notice */\n.notice {\n  margin-top: 10px;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  border: 1px solid #fcd34d;\n  background: #fffbeb;\n  color: #92400e;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  font-size: 15px;\n}\n\n/* Controls */\n.section-title {\n  margin: 14px 0 10px 0;\n  font-size: 18px;\n}\n\n.button-row {\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  display: inline-block;\n  margin: 6px 6px 0 0;\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  border: 1px solid #d1d5db;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  color: #0f172a;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.btn:hover {\n  background: #fff2eb;              /* soft coral hover */\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n  background: #ffd4c1;\n  border-color: #f5b199;\n  color: #7c2d12;\n}\n\n.btn-danger {\n  background: #ffe2e2;\n  border-color: #ffc9c9;\n  color: #b91c1c;\n}\n\n.btn-ghost {\n  background: #f3f4f6;\n}\n\n/* Footer */\n.site-footer {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 18px 12px;\n  color: #64748b;\n}\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "// variable for tickets\nlet tickets = 0;\n\n// references to display elements and buttons\nconst ticketCount = document.getElementById('ticketCount');\nconst badgeQueue  = document.getElementById('badgeQueue');\nconst output      = document.getElementById('output');\n\nconst btnNew    = document.getElementById('btnNew');\nconst btnAssign = document.getElementById('btnAssign');\nconst btnClose  = document.getElementById('btnClose');\nconst btnReset  = document.getElementById('btnReset');\n\n// New Ticket button\n\n\n// Assign Tech button\n\n\n// Close Ticket button\n\n\n// Reset Desk button\n\n\n// initial display\nticketCount.textContent = String(tickets);\nbadgeQueue.textContent  = String(tickets);\noutput.textContent      = 'Ready.';\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "3"
      ]
    },
